@startuml
title Memento Pattern - Outfit Designer

class StoreController {
    - _outfitDesigner : OutfitDesigner
    - _outfitHistory : OutfitHistory

    + Memento() : IActionResult
    + UpdateOutfitDraft(...) : IActionResult
    + SaveOutfitSnapshot() : IActionResult
    + UndoOutfit() : IActionResult
    + RedoOutfit() : IActionResult
    - ConfigureMementoViewData(message : string) : void
}

class OutfitDesigner {
    - Top : string
    - Bottom : string
    - Shoes : string
    - Accessory : string
    - ColorPalette : string
    - Notes : string

    + UpdateOutfit(top, bottom, shoes, accessory, colorPalette, notes) : void
    + Save() : OutfitDraftMemento
    + Restore(snapshot : OutfitDraftMemento) : void
}

class OutfitDraftMemento {
    - Top : string
    - Bottom : string
    - Shoes : string
    - Accessory : string
    - ColorPalette : string
    - Notes : string
    + SavedAt : DateTime

    + GetLabel() : string
}

class OutfitHistory {
    - undoStack : Stack<OutfitDraftMemento>
    - redoStack : Stack<OutfitDraftMemento>

    + UndoCount : int
    + RedoCount : int

    + SaveState(designer : OutfitDesigner) : void
    + Undo(designer : OutfitDesigner) : bool
    + Redo(designer : OutfitDesigner) : bool
    + GetHistoryLabels() : List<string>
}

StoreController --> OutfitDesigner : folosește
StoreController --> OutfitHistory : folosește

OutfitDesigner --> OutfitDraftMemento : creează snapshot
OutfitDesigner --> OutfitDraftMemento : restaurează stare

OutfitHistory o-- OutfitDraftMemento : păstrează istoric
OutfitHistory --> OutfitDesigner : salvează / restaurează

note right of OutfitDesigner
Originator
Deține starea ținutei curente.
Creează și restaurează snapshot-uri.
end note

note right of OutfitDraftMemento
Memento
Păstrează starea salvată
fără a expune direct logica internă.
end note

note right of OutfitHistory
Caretaker
Gestionează Undo / Redo
fără să modifice conținutul snapshot-ului.
end note

@enduml